{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Schur引理"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Schur 引理"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>设 $X,Y$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Abel范畴","text":"Abel 范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"单对象","text":"单对象"}},{"Plain":", 则</p>\n<ul>\n<li>任一态射 $X \\to Y$ 为同构或 $0$;</li>\n<li>$X$ 的自同构环 $\\operatorname{End}(X)$ 为除环.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}